  "contracts": {
    "actorless": "DesktopLessonRepository methods have no ActorContext or SessionLease. Unbound repository guard denies. Guard rebinding only AND-tightens. False/panic maps to ordinary ExecutionCancelled/Unavailable.",
    "managed": "Original LessonRepository and apply exact-management authorization remain; authenticated override provenance maps to LessonInitiator::Authenticated(real principal).",
    "writer": "One transaction binds actual current class, catalog/schedule/lesson revisions, exact LessonInstanceKey, trusted clock and persisted/memory high-water; same precommit re-observation/health capability/execution fences; no new worker or native resource.",
    "audit": "Strict new format3 tagged initiator Authenticated|LocalDesktop; complete old1/2 actor forms accepted, no force-write on read; original projection makes live override inactive on ordinary/mapped restore.",
    "budgets": "MAX_LESSON_INTERVALS64 and 64KiB per document/outcome/receipt retained. Source exposes bounded enabled subject and current-class teacher display choices without authentication data.",
    "delivery": "Guard checked before enqueue, writer evaluate, precommit, after actual ticket completion and again after decoding. Unknown postcommit cancellation never claims rollback."
  },
